    "The current cue has unsaved changes. Press Command-S first; after it is saved, the cue linked to the Logic project will load." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前 Cue 尚未儲存。請先按 Command-S，儲存完成後會載入 Logic 專案所連結的 Cue。"}}}},
